# Build products and generated intermediates, never committed: each README has the steps that make them.
# wifi-work/ regenerates from wifi-amazon/ with wifi/port.py, codec-work/ from the Amazon kernel source with
# patches/port-aic3101.py; initramfs/firmware/ is filled from the unit's own boot image (tools/prepare-firmware.py).
*/out/
cronos/wifi-work/
cronos/codec-work/
cronos/logs/
cronos/initramfs/firmware/*
!cronos/initramfs/firmware/LICENSE
